{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103060","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710306001:1":{"text":"분대장님, 상층 지구에는 어쩐 일이십니까? 지시를 내려주십시오!","source_cn":"队长，您怎么亲自来上城区了！请您下达指示！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AEFCF5F26413BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710306002:1":{"text":"크레인, 사령관님께서 오늘 여기에 오신 적이 있나?","source_cn":"克雷因，司令今天有没有来过这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x205ABB542988DB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710306003:1":{"text":"사령관님께서는 조금 전에 다녀 가셨습니다! 굉장히 급해 보이셨는데...","source_cn":"司令早些时候确实来过！他来得很急，说他刚收到一份紧急报告——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DE6A41F3728A349","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710306004:1":{"text":"상록수 전시관장 알라인 님께서 실종되었다는 보고를 받고 오셨습니다!","source_cn":"冬青展览馆的馆长阿莱茵女士失踪了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF31FB0D37DB7509B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710306005:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">알라인 </style>님 사건을 직접 확인하러 오신 듯했습니다.","source_cn":"他来这里，就是为了亲自核查<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C1052A49A48CB0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docum